/v1/","context":{"app_id":4977420,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4977420-1847286114042918","game_id":"steam-4977420","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank you for playing! New trailer, and the Act 1 boss is still waiting","summary":"Thank you to everyone who played the KleptoMagia demo and shared feedback during Steam Next Fest. We read every comment and every bug report, and they are already shaping the game. We hope you enjoyed it! If you haven't tried the demo yet, it's still free: jump into the real-time fights and see if you can beat the boss of Act 1. Above, our new trailer. One more thing: we'll announce the Early Access release date very soon. Stay tuned, here and on our other socials! Play the free demoThe KleptoMa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T20:29:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114042918","verified_at":"2026-10-25T21:52:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4977420-1847286114033774","game_id":"steam-4977420","kind":"announcement","title":"Dr Incompetent on KleptoMagia Demo: Gameplay out now!","summary":"Dr Incompetent just played the KleptoMagia demo, and the gameplay is now live on YouTube! KleptoMagia is an action roguelike deckbuilder in real time: no turns, you play your cards while the fight is happening. See how his run goes, then try the free demo yourself. The KleptoMagia Team","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T18:07:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033774","verified_at":"2026-10-22T23:01:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4977420-1846651706695103","game_id":"steam-4977420","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank you, Pro-Gamer","summary":"Thank you, Pro-Gamer Yesterday, a few hours before Steam Next Fest opened, Charles \"Grimtag\" Ronchain of Pro-Gamer published an article about the KleptoMagia demo. It was one of the best surprises of the week. He writes that over the last three years he has seen dozens of Slay the Spire-style games, and that most of them add a secondary gauge without ever changing the rhythm of the fight itself. What stood out to him in ours is a double move:\"removing the turn-based safety net while turning ever","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T12:43:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706695103","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:54:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4977420-1846651706691694","game_id":"steam-4977420","kind":"announcement","title":"How to survive Act 1","summary":"KleptoMagia is a roguelike deckbuilder with no turns. Enemies cast as the fight unfolds, and you answer with the right card at the right moment.If real-time card combat is new to you, here are four things that make the first act easier.1. Do your studying before the fightBefore each fight you see the enemy’s spells and its Traits, and you mark the one spell you want to steal. That screen is where you can read everything while nothing is moving, so take your time there. Press T to open the Traits","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:17:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691694","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:54:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4977420-1846651706684777","game_id":"steam-4977420","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: A Fairer First Act","summary":"KleptoMagia is a real-time deckbuilder with no turns.Enemies cast as the fight unfolds, and you answer with the right card at the right moment.We have been watching how new players tackle the demo's first act, and those early fights could be too punishing, especially if real-time card combat is new to you.This didn't come only from our players.Our game director, while travelling abroad, spent most of the flight with a ROG Ally trying, and failing, to beat the first boss in an earlier build.After","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T15:05:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684777","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:54:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4977420-1846651706682802","game_id":"steam-4977420","kind":"announcement","title":"Casual Ties Studio announces KleptoMagia","summary":"Hello Steam! We're Casual Ties Studio, a small indie team built on AAA experience, and we're excited to finally show you KleptoMagia. What is KleptoMagia?A real-time deckbuilder with no turns. Enemies cast live, the clock never stops, and every card you play is a split-second decision. Cast wisely and react fast. Your deck is the plan, but timing decides whether it works. Don't have the spell you need? Steal it from someone who does. How it playsReal-time combat: read enemy casts, time your card","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T18:54:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682802","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:54:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4977420":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:54:07Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:54:06Z","error_codes":[]}},"ne